complete engineering loop.

13
00:00:34,523 --> 00:00:37,743
Understand, plan, build, verify, integrate.

14
00:00:38,483 --> 00:00:39,643
Those names aren't magic.

15
00:00:40,223 --> 00:00:42,363
The useful part is what each stage leaves

16
00:00:42,363 --> 00:00:42,883
