25
00:01:02,583 --> 00:01:04,883
What's the smallest change
that gets us there?

26
00:01:05,463 --> 00:01:07,183
How could we catch ourselves being wrong?

27
00:01:07,823 --> 00:01:10,143
And which exact revision are we accepting?

28
00:01:10,823 --> 00:01:12,823
A surprising answer sends us back to the

29
00:01:12,823 --> 00:01:13,583
relevant question.

30
00:01:14,163 --> 00:01:15,983
